=== Python actually compiles generators to state machines ===
  Bytecode of original_gen (showing YIELD_VALUE / RESUME):
      4  RESUME               0
      6  LOAD_CONST           1
      8  YIELD_VALUE          1
     10  RESUME               1
     14  LOAD_CONST           2
     16  YIELD_VALUE          1
     18  RESUME               1
     22  LOAD_CONST           3
     24  YIELD_VALUE          1
     26  RESUME               1
     30  RETURN_CONST         None

=== Generators and first-class continuations ===
  Generator-as-CPS result: [1, 2, 3]
